<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel’s forces have recently destroyed an underground Hezbollah infrastructure in south Lebanon and a Hezbollah tunnel in Shebaa, while also launching operations in central Gaza and a Hamas-controlled area of Gaza. Iraq has moved its army into a stronghold of the Iran-backed Kataib Hezbollah, linking the regional fight to the Israel-Hezbollah clash. Hezbollah and Iran have recruited Thai clerics for a foiled plot to attack the Israeli embassy in Bangkok, and Israeli officials have threatened to seize more territory in Gaza, Lebanon and Syria. The World Bank notes Lebanon’s reconstruction is proceeding slowly, and the UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOYVJhNkh1T3o0WTcxV1BHX3ltY1RVR0RqT2RlaXFnNmdXUXRsVkFLZTlGZmdPQTk4ZFR6YmloelV2SnZPWjh3czFEMmptSzNYeEFVMFF6cFJqNDhMalpIbzJ0MmJ2MjhnQ19aMXZDdFNMTV9YemNLR1RxXzBFX2ljT2VtRThEblE3Mnc3NzllV2hpTEI1RFV0SmZOeE5oRXVScXA1ZzBxcVpuSzR0T0JybUMtUjgwSXFZZ2VVTTNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZU5DS3NuSWJWNm5XZnRncVh2QXluV0VaclRKajlnQXpqdUV6WUVPb0EwakdRLTh1T3FyWGlfMkZ6cDVKbzc1NTBiMTVqaE1ycWhDS3F0SU1yQ1FvcFJWa295ZS13T3FRNTBmc1FYbVN4OEd3eUhnY2VPejk2QnJGZzhpYVAzZlN1bTVOa2xBZUVWYVlvNFdwWGZUMkVJM2FZanZvUTk2RlNTTnZ5bGROeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Naharnet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcElfSUJFT2pjbTFlY2EtUDk5cFJfNTN0bmpTd1Vyc2ZBMm8wUUNkR2V6NW9QUUxZRmxOeWlEYmVsRjh1XzZHNm5VTDVZNUZ5Tm00SEhNSFJpR1ZPdmUybE82M3FSSnB4clBWZ3NyckNQbUVaM05nVkNid2ltYkhIU2RYZjBNNExidjFtNHJfQk83c21ZeE90UjlYNlVRczNjTVFYdDUxamRVVkV4Rmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;London Evening Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article